  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 7.2. Increased capacity of Member States to ensure safe and healthy working conditions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In May 2023, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development developed a national electronic system and platform for recording, notification and investigation of occupational accidents, injuries and diseases. The system is currently operational and releases annual reports, which data are gender-disaggregated. With the support from the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, the ILO provided technical guidance and inputs for developing the system. Technical inputs provided included the type and quality of information to be collected as well as on the relevant legislation and templates.</narrative>
   </description>
